00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.120
the old Doctor Who or something.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.560
Well, wouldn't a godly light creature,

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.680
like a supercomputer named Dark,

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.060
wouldn't those things take on a different appearance

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.820
