Yeah, yeah, yeah. That's what I'm saying.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.840
Like things beyond comprehension and stuff like that.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.360
Like they wouldn't look exactly like the...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.480
They wouldn't have the face of the angel.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:40.560
I would say that if like if there was an AI that took over the world,

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.700
it wouldn't even adopt a face because, you know,

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:44.800
humans are so puny.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:45.640
Yeah, take that Dark.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.980
Yeah. You stupid idiot.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.060
So Dark, I think like, you know,

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.360
if you're smarter than us,

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.660
then don't play down to our level.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.360
Like just be yourself.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.460
Maybe it's trying to...

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.640
At first, they try to like lull the humans

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.720
into a false sense of security.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:58.680
Be like, look, I'm one of you.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.140
I'm just made out of plastic or something.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:03.140
